00:37:45,302 --> 00:37:46,383
[SPEAKER_00]: So that you can actually see it.

439
00:37:46,523 --> 00:37:56,369
[SPEAKER_00]: Ah, actually, no, even that, when I, in passing, in careless thinking, regard, oh, my consciousness, or this, or rather, just consciousness already implies mind for most of the people.

