[SPEAKER_00]: Experience was not responsible for any assumption at all, in any shape or form.

483
00:40:44,323 --> 00:40:47,083
[SPEAKER_00]: What was responsible is you not understanding experience.

484
00:40:47,704 --> 00:40:51,825
[SPEAKER_00]: Now that you have understood the experience, the result of that is cessation of assumptions.

485
00:40:53,045 --> 00:40:59,507
[SPEAKER_00]: And now that you have understood it, you cannot un-understand it and then bring back the assumptions.

486
