489
00:41:13,336 --> 00:41:14,096
[SPEAKER_00]: Full understanding.

490
00:41:15,136 --> 00:41:20,578
[SPEAKER_00]: Not some perfect adherence to this method, or to that method, or to this mantra.

491
00:41:20,618 --> 00:41:20,798
[SPEAKER_00]: No.

492
00:41:20,839 --> 00:41:23,239
[SPEAKER_00]: It's full understanding.

493
00:41:23,279 --> 00:41:26,101
[SPEAKER_00]: And you understand things when you fully know them, really.

